{
  "_id": "tg-hypocrisy",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "hypocrite shall not come before him, Job 13:16. congregation of hypocrites shall be desolate, Job 15:34. speak peace … but mischief is in their hearts, Ps. 28:3. hypocrite with his mouth destroyeth his neighbour, Prov. 11:9. Lord shall have no joy … for every one is an hypocrite, Isa. 9:17. I will send him against an hypocritical nation, Isa. 10:6. draw near me with their mouth … removed their heart, Isa. 29:13 (Matt. 15:18; Mark 7:6; JS—H 1:19). vile person will … practise hypocrisy, Isa. 32:6. ye shall not fast … to make your voice to be heard, Isa. 58:4 (Alma 38:13). speaketh peaceably … but in heart he layeth his wait, Jer. 9:8.",
